{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>A man or a woman, when there is among them an ov or a yiddoni.</b> And since the intent in all these matters was to sanctify Israel, one who deviates from this by means of an ov or yiddoni — whose entire concern is a spirit of impurity, the opposite of everything intended — is fit to be stoned without doubt."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:04.796382076Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}